:: MP World Deep Router [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes to ($mpSeenScenes or {})>>
<<set _allWorldScenes to ["MP World Event Loose Cobble", "MP World Event Curio Peddler", "MP World Event Smuggler Drop", "MP World Event Driftwood Chest", "MP World Event Forest Shrine", "MP World Event Park Sketchbook", "MP World Event Temple Censer", "MP World Event Sewer Cache", "MP World Event Barb Patrol", "MP World Event Danube Carriage", "MP World Event School Corridor", "MP World Event Pool Steam", "MP World Event Arcade Neon", "MP World Event Shopping Mirror", "MP World Event Hospital Night", "MP World Event Brothel Backdoor", "MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow", "MP World Domus PostboxEnvelope", "MP World Barb CrushedWhistleTin", "MP World Danube IronGateSpectacles", "MP World Connudatus PosterCompactBox", "MP World Cliff BenchArmrestRoll", "MP World Wolf HitchingRingPouch", "MP World High HydrantCardCase", "MP World Starfish IceCreamPostTin", "MP World Nightingale VentAmberVial", "MP World Oxford UmbrellaStandPenBox", "MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag", "MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock", "MP World Harvest FlourSackCashbox", "MP World ResAlley GeraniumPotWrap", "MP World ComAlley FreightShaftPurse", "MP World IndAlley BoilerColdAshBox", "MP World Beach CabanaSpyglassTube", "MP World SeaRocks ReefCorkBottle", "MP World BeachCave StalactiteTinderbox", "MP World Forest CypressRootTin", "MP World Library TopBeamBookmarkTin", "MP World Canteen MilkCrateCoinPurse", "MP World TempleGarden RosebushCeladonVial", "MP World OceanBreeze ParasolTieClip", "MP World Pub KegStackWineskin", "MP World Police ReportBoxParchment", "MP World AdultShop ExhaustVelvetBag", "MP World Garden ToolshedRustedCan", "MP World Orphanage UnderstairsWoodBox", "MP World Bedroom BaseboardIronTin"]>>
<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes.filter(function (n) { return !$mpSeenScenes[n]; })>>
<<if _pool.length is 0>>
	<<set _pool to _allWorldScenes>>
	<<set $mpSeenScenes to {}>>
<</if>>
<<set _pick to _pool.random()>>
<<set $mpSeenScenes[_pick] to 1>>
<<include _pick>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你走过宅邸街拐角时，脚下一块松动的青石板微微下陷了半寸。石板边缘的湿苔刚被人用扁铁刮开，露出新刻的白色三角记号。冬青篱笆后方静悄悄的，只有风吹过铁艺信箱的轻响。你停住脚步低头打量，盘算着要不要撬开石板看看。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[撬开松动石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬开松动石板 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬开松动石板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[躲在篱笆后观察 (0:08)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Wait]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[向罗宾搭话 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">向罗宾搭话 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你蹲在墙根阴影里，用指尖扣住青石板边缘慢慢往上抬。砖槽下方裹着一层防潮油纸，隐约露出铜币与字条的边角。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-inspect">
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "指尖撬青石板 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to ((($mpDomusRunnerSeen or 0) is 1) ? 220 : 300)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 900>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 780>><<elseif _sk gte 400>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["bailey_domus_drop"]>><<set $mpClues["bailey_domus_drop"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你顺着砖缝轻轻抽起油纸包，摸出几枚旧银币与半张记着门牌缩写的催缴底单。你把大约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的硬币收进口袋。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_loose_cobble_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[核对底单门牌 (0:06)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[翻进邻院木棚 (0:08)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
石板底下卡着一根生锈的防盗铁钉，猛地划破了你的食指指腹。院墙内传来猎犬凶狠的狂吠，你只好空手把石板放回原位。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[指尖撬青石板 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "指尖撬青石板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Wait [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你缩进修剪整齐的冬青树篱后方，借着浓密的枝叶遮住身形。过了不到一刻钟，一名压低帽檐的少年快步走过拐角，用鞋尖在青石板右侧轻轻磕了两下。他确认石板未动便匆匆离去，让你看清了避开砖槽铁钉的巧劲。你缓缓吐出一口气，紧绷的神经放松下来。
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["bailey_domus_drop"]>><span class="teal">你记着松动青石板下的暗号磕击声，隔着冬青树篱一眼认出了交接少年的手势。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mplockpickicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[趁没人撬开石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<set $mpDomusRunnerSeen to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[趁没人撬开石板 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "趁没人撬开石板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[去找罗宾 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk]]>><<set $mpDomusRunnerSeen to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去找罗宾 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Talk [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>正抱着一摞洗净的亚麻床单从街对面走来，看见你蹲在墙角便停下了脚步。「你也注意到那个白粉笔三角了吗？」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>左右看了看，压低声音对你说，「前天夜里贝利派人去工业区地下的高压泵站送过一样的账袋。」说完<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>熟识的院童<</if>>冲你露出关切的微笑，叮嘱你在街上多加小心。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头查探青石板 (0:05)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Inspect]]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[比对底单暗号 (0:06)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<set $mpKnown["clockwork_vault"] to 1>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<getouticon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Robin")>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">离开 (0:08)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你靠在路灯铁柱下展开那半张油纸，上面密密麻麻写着一串倒置的门牌数字与日期。你顺着宅邸街两侧的门牌号逐一推算其中的进位规律。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回宅邸街 (0:08)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-cipher">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($english or 0) gte 300>><<link "推算门牌规律 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-cipher">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 300 or ($english or 0) gte 300>>
	<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["bailey_ledger_code"]>><<set $mpClues["bailey_ledger_code"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	<<if (($maths or 0) gte 600 or ($english or 0) gte 600) and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_cobble_cipher")>>
		<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
	<</if>>
	你很快算出每组数字都代表着孤儿院欠款的拆借利息，还在折痕夹层里摸到一枚铜质火漆印章。这套暗码足以在查账时派上用场。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[转进邻院木棚 (0:08)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
	纸面上的缩写符号夹杂着多处涂改，你看来看去只觉得头昏脑涨。冷风吹得纸页哗哗作响，你只好先把底单折好收起。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Cipher]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[推算门牌规律 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "推算门牌规律">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "数学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
巷口忽然传来沉重的皮靴声，一名替院长收账的打手正朝拐角走来。你立刻翻过低矮的木栅栏，闪身钻进邻院堆放园艺工具的木棚里。
<<if $mpClues["bailey_ledger_code"]>><span class="teal">凭着刚默记下来的黑皮账册收款缩略码，你在工具棚暗处迅速理清了脱身路线。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回街上 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-shed">
<<runicon>><<link "跃上干草垫 (0:03)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-loose-cobble-shed">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['bailey_ledger_code'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 700>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif ($athletics or 0) gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你轻巧地落在干草垫上，顺手从挂在木钉上的旧猎装口袋里摸出一袋散碎银币，约有 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。打手在墙外停了片刻便走远了。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_loose_cobble_shed")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[绕回石板拐角 (0:08)|MP World Event Loose Cobble]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<<else>>
你落地时脚踝拌在铁锹柄上，发出清脆的碰撞声。你捂住磕疼的膝盖屏住呼吸，直到墙外的脚步声远去才敢挪动。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Loose Cobble Shed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
高街廊檐下的流动旧货摊前，一名披着灰斗篷的货郎正低头擦拭几只沾满铜绿的航海罗盘。油布摊面上摆着旧发条盒、黄铜望远镜筒与散落的外国硬币。货郎听见你的脚步声，抬起半掩在兜帽下的眼睛打量了你一下。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[挑拣摊上铜器 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑拣摊上铜器 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑拣摊上铜器">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[花三镑买旧币 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Bargain]]>><<if $money gte 300>><<money -300>><<set $mpWorldEventCurioBargainPaid to 1>><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[帮他分拣机芯 (0:15)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你蹲在旧货摊边，手指掠过几只生锈的铁皮怀表，停在一只刻着海浪纹的扁平黄铜鼻烟盒上。盒底的接缝比寻常器物厚了半分，似乎藏着双层夹板。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-inspect">
<<mpsmokeicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320>><<link "拨鼻烟盒底盖 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-inspect">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 320 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($history or 0), ($skulduggery or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 640>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Curio_Peddler")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你借着袖口掩护按开盒底暗簧，摸出夹层里的旧金镑与一张航海图残角，转手兑出了约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_curio_peddler_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进摊后帆布棚 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[替货郎看街口 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
你用力掰扯盒盖时发出咔哒异响，货郎立刻伸手把鼻烟盒收回绒布袋里，冷冷地盯着你看了半晌。
<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨鼻烟盒底盖 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨鼻烟盒底盖">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Bargain [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
<<set _paid to ($mpWorldEventCurioBargainPaid or 0)>><<set $mpWorldEventCurioBargainPaid to 0>>
<<if _paid>>
<<set $mpKnown["foghorn_pier"] to 1>>
你摸出几枚硬币放在油布上，指了指那枚印着灯塔与折断船锚的古怪铜币。货郎将硬币扫进掌心，压低嗓音说：「认得这枚雾角锚记的人可不多，退潮时顺着海礁往外走，就能登上雾角栈桥。」他把铜币塞进你手里，示意你去后面的帆布棚避风细看。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[进入摊后帆布棚 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[留下帮忙分拣 (0:15)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<<else>>
你摸遍口袋也凑不出那几枚硬币。货郎把铜币收回油布下，摇了摇头。
<</if>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
货郎递给你一瓶煤油与一把硬毛小刷，让你把木盘里沾满海盐结晶的黄铜齿轮按齿数分好。你在小马扎上坐下，借着廊檐天光逐一清理零件上的锈迹。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-appraise">
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 300>><<link "刷净齿轮分拣 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-appraise">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), ($housekeeping or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1300>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 1000>><<else>><<set _reward to 720>><</if>>
你手脚麻利地将二十多枚擒纵轮分门别类摆好，货郎满意地点点头，数出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的工钱递给你。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_curio_peddler_appraise")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[退进帆布棚 (0:03)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
刺鼻的煤油味熏得你眼眶发酸，你不小心把两枚细小的游丝弄混在了一起，被货郎皱着眉头扣下了报酬。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Appraise]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[刷净齿轮分拣 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "刷净齿轮分拣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Tent [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "commercial">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
廊檐后方的防雨帆布棚挡住了街面的寒风，棚内点着一盏温暖的防风马灯。货郎掀开罗盘底盖给你看了一行刻在铜片上的潮汐时刻：「每逢初七夜潮，雾角灯塔的备用油船都会按这个刻度靠岸。」你把那串数字默记在心里，冻僵的指尖也渐渐回暖。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[替货郎望哨 (0:06)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpstallicon>><<link [[返回摊位 (0:02)|MP World Event Curio Peddler]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
两名便衣巡警忽然从高街路口走来，目光径直锁定了廊檐下的流动旧货摊。货郎脸色微变，急忙用胳膊肘碰了碰你，示意你帮他把那匣未打税的怀表塞进排水沟暗格。
<<if $mpClues["smuggler_compass_mark"]>><span class="teal">你认出怀表底盖上的私港罗盘暗记，赶在巡警靠近前不动声色地替货郎遮住了木匣。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-watch">
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 350>><<link "借披肩藏匣 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-curio-peddler-watch">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 350>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 1100>><<else>><<set _reward to 800>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_curio_watch")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你假装系鞋带蹲下身，三两下将木匣推入铁栅内侧。巡警搜查无果离开后，货郎塞给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的封口费。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_curio_peddler_watch")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回旧货摊 (0:03)|MP World Event Curio Peddler]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的手指刚碰到木匣就被巡警厉声喝止，一名巡警上前推了你一把，你的后背重重撞在廊柱上。
<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Curio Peddler Watch]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[借披肩藏匣 (0:02)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "借披肩藏匣">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalertinit "docks">><<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
码头暗巷的排水铁栅旁塞着一只涂满石蜡的防水油布包，上面还带着咸腥的海水味。不远处的货运栈桥下传来低沉的柴油机怠速声，似乎是走私暗桩刚放下的交接货。你贴着集装箱的阴影停下脚步，观察着四周的动静。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[勾铁栅旁油布包 (0:06)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "铁栅轻响">><<else>><<link [[勾铁栅旁油布包 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "勾铁栅旁油布包">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<link [[观察船坞风灯 (0:06)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Signal]]>><<pass 6>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "缩进货垛阴影">>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[潜进木船棚 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着船棚潜行">>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
你蹲在排水铁栅边，趁着巡逻哨兵转过堆场拐角的空档，将手指探进铁条缝隙勾住油布包的麻绳。油布包沉甸甸的，里面似乎垫着金属器皿。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "勾油布包麻绳 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to ((($mpDockDropEdge or 0) is 1) ? 250 : 350)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1500>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1150>><<else>><<set _reward to 820>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Smuggler_Drop")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你巧劲一拧便将油布包完整拖了出来，从夹层摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的暗市现钞与铅封货单。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_smuggler_drop_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "铁栅轻响">>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去缆绳堆找熟人 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren]]>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着缆绳堆移动">>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[踩跳板退回岸边 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "退回岸边阴影">>
<<else>>
沉重的生铁栅栏突然滑落，狠狠夹中了你的手腕。巷口哨兵的手电光柱扫了过来，你只好忍痛缩手退后。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "栅栏滑落">>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "再撬铁栅">>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[勾油布包麻绳 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "勾油布包麻绳">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Signal [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>你躲进堆满防水油布的货垛后面，静静听着外海雾角传来两长一短的低鸣。紧接着，东侧防波堤尽头的旧船坞亮起三下绿光，一艘无标驳船顺着暗流滑进了黑铁货运滑道。你看清了哨兵换岗的间隙，心里对接下来的行动更有把握了。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头取油布包 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Inspect]]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>><<set $mpDockDropEdge to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着货垛移动">>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进木造船棚 (0:05)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<set $mpKnown["blackiron_siding"] to 1>><<set $mpDockDropEdge to 1>><<pass 5>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "潜进船棚">>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "docks_building">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
木造船棚内弥漫着桐油与松木屑的气味，隔绝了外面的海风。角落里立着一只印有折断船锚烙印的杉木箱，箱盖四周钉着一圈铁皮箍条，旁边放着半截铁撬棍。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-shed">
<<mplockpickicon>><<link "撬开杉木箱盖 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-shed">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 9000>>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 14000>><<set _reward to 1300>><<elseif ($physique or 0) gte 11500>><<set _reward to 1000>><<else>><<set _reward to 720>><</if>>
你握紧铁撬棍抵住木箱接缝，沉腰发力将铁皮箍条整根撬起，从刨花底下摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的押运定金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_smuggler_drop_shed")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 8>><<mpalertgain "铁皮箍条撬响">>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[去缆绳堆交涉 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着船棚移动">>
<<else>>
你用尽全力往下压撬棍，木箱纹丝不动，反震的力道震得你虎口发麻，肩膀也隐隐作痛。
<<pain 3>><<tiredness 3>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "撬棍滑脱">>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Shed]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalert 8>><</link>><<mpalertgain "再撬箱盖">>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Wren [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
一名戴着毛线帽的码头水手正靠在粗麻缆绳堆上抽烟，看见你手里的石蜡碎屑便挑了挑眉。「<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>交代过，这批货要是有人动过就改走雾角水道。」水手吐出一口白烟，把一张画着暗礁航标的草图塞进你手心。他压低声音催促你别在铁栅边久留，因为海关快艇今晚查得很严。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[贴防波堤绕艇 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"]>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴防波堤移动">>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回栅栏 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"]>><<set $mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 3>><<mpalert 6>><</link>><<mpalertgain "贴着堆场移动">>

:: MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<mpalerttext>><<mpalertcheck>>
尖锐的铜哨声忽然划破码头夜雾，两名提着防风灯的海关稽查员从栈桥另一端包抄过来。你必须趁他们合围前跨过湿滑的系船浮板。
<<if $mpClues["smuggler_wren_route"]>><span class="teal">你想起<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Wren")>>雷恩<<else>>走私客<</if>>用粉笔标出的系船浮板捷径，踩上湿滑跳板时步点丝毫不乱。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-escape">
<<runicon>><<link "踩浮板跃上堤 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-smuggler-drop-escape">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['smuggler_wren_route'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 350>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif ($athletics or 0) gte 550>><<set _reward to 750>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
你助跑两步踩上系船铁柱，干净利落地翻上高处货台，顺手捡起暗桩逃跑时掉在木板上的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 零钞。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_smuggler_drop_escape")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "踩响浮板">>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[绕回暗巷入口 (0:03)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop]]>><<pass 3>><<mpalert -5>><</link>><<mpalertloss "缩回集装箱缝隙">>
<<else>>
湿滑的海藻让你在浮板上脚下一滑，小腿重重磕在铁链上，你狼狈地滚进集装箱缝隙才躲过搜捕。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>><<trauma 1>><<mpalert 12>><<mpalertgain "铁链撞响">>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Smuggler Drop Escape]]>><<pass 4>><<mpalert 12>><</link>><<mpalertgain "再踩浮板">>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
退潮的海浪在礁石浅滩边冲上了一只缠满墨绿海带的樟木小匣，黄铜搭扣已经在海水浸泡下松脱了大半。冰凉的浪花不断拍打着礁盘，每当浪头退去，木匣就会在石缝间微微晃动。你站在干湿交界的沙地上，打量着礁石间的潮水深浅。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[涉水捞樟木匣 (0:06)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<bedicon>><<link [[坐等潮水退平 (0:08)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Tide]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进礁后海洞 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你挽起裤脚踏进冰凉的海水里，双手扣住樟木小匣两侧往外拔。湿滑的墨绿海带缠在礁石棱角上，需要不小的力气才能扯断。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-inspect">
<<swimicon>><<link "扯断海带取匣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-inspect">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 8500 or ($mpBeachTideCalm or 0) is 1>>
	<<set _sk to ($swimmingskill or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 900>><<else>><<set _reward to 620>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 600 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Driftwood_Chest")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你稳住下盘扯断海带，扳开铜扣从防水内胆里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的古银币与一枚航海怀表。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_driftwood_chest_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问岸边泳客 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[应对突发暗涌 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
一股暗涌突然拍在你的膝弯上，你的脚掌滑进布满藤壶的石槽，锋利的贝壳划破了脚踝皮肤。
<<pain 4>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Tide [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>你没有急着下水，而是坐在一块晒得微温的花岗岩上，静静数着拍岸的浪头。等到第七道大浪退向深海，礁盘凹槽里的积水顺着石缝哗哗流干，那只樟木小匣完完全全露在了干爽的沙砾上。温和的海风拂过脸颊，让你紧绷的肩背松弛下来。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前打开木匣 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Inspect]]>><<set $mpBeachTideCalm to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[探查礁后海洞 (0:05)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<set $mpBeachTideCalm to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "searocks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
礁石后方的岩洞挡住了海面上的风浪，洞顶垂下几缕干燥的海草。洞壁角落堆着几块早年沉船冲进来的旧船板，木缝里卡着一只黄铜密封筒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-cave">
<<mpsewicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>><<link "撬木缝取密封筒 (0:05)">><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-cave">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 760>><<else>><<set _reward to 540>><</if>>
<<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["wreck_chart_fragment"]>><<set $mpClues["wreck_chart_fragment"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
你避开腐朽的木刺拧开铜筒，抽出半卷标着暗礁水道的羊皮海图，并在船板下捡到约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_driftwood_chest_cave")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[出洞找泳客 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你的手刚伸进船板底下就惊动了一群藏在暗处的青蟹，密密麻麻的声响吓得你急忙缩手后退。
<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Cave]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撬木缝取密封筒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撬木缝取密封筒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Diver [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>正站在防波堤阶梯旁用毛巾擦拭湿发，看见你手里拿着一块带船徽的樟木片便走了过来。「这是早年雾角商船上的徽记，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>指了指远海雾气笼罩的方向，「灯塔岛东侧有片断桅沉船滩，退潮时经常能看到整排的旧船肋木。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>笑着拍了拍你的肩膀，叮嘱你下水时注意暗流。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<<if $mpClues["wreck_chart_fragment"]>><span class="teal">你捏着从漂流木箱里起出的商船樟木徽记，与<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>核对起远海暗礁的旧航道。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[去浅滩试水 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回浅滩 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest]]>><<set $mpKnown["foghorn_wreck"] to 1>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你正准备从礁盘边缘转身离开，一道半人高的白头浪忽然越过外侧礁脊，裹挟着冰冷的泡沫狠狠拍向你的腰际。脚下的细沙在回卷暗流中迅速流失。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回海滩 (0:02)|Beach]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "beach">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-undertow">
<<swimicon>><<link "蹬暗礁稳住身形 (0:03)">><<pass 3>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-driftwood-chest-undertow">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	你咬紧牙关屏住呼吸，双手死死扣住身旁的玄武岩凸起，等浪头泄尽力道才稳步跨上干爽的沙岸。
	<<willpower 1>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回浅滩 (0:03)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	冰冷的浪涌冲得你重心尽失，你在咸涩的海水里呛了一口，手脚并用地爬上沙滩时已经累得气喘吁吁。
	<<tiredness 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Driftwood Chest Undertow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
林间两棵合抱粗的古橡树之间立着一座布满青苔的小石龛，龛内散落着半干的蓝冠草与几枚奉纳旧币。树冠筛下斑驳的绿影，空气里透着腐殖土与松针的清香。石龛底座的一角微微翘起，似乎曾有守林人在此落脚。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($history or 0) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>><<link [[查探供台石板 (0:06)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><<else>><<link [[查探供台石板 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "查探供台石板">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[采周边草药 (0:12)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Herbs]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[向猎人问路 (0:05)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Gwylan]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你蹲在石龛正面，小心拨开缠绕在底座四周的刺藤与枯叶。松动的青石供台下方有一道干燥的石槽，里面隐约泛着青铜器物的幽光。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>><<link "拨刺藤摸供台 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-inspect">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($tending or 0), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 820>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Forest_Shrine")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你顺着藤蔓生长的方向轻轻挑开尖刺，从石槽里摸出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的奉纳银币与一尊青铜小鹿。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_forest_shrine_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[钻进古树根洞 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Hollow]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[警惕林间狼嚎 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
隐藏在枯叶底下的黑刺李尖刺扎进了你的掌心，火辣辣的刺痛让你急忙把手指缩了回来。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨刺藤摸供台 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨刺藤摸供台">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Herbs [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
石龛北侧的背阴潮湿处长着一小片叶片肥厚的野生蓝冠草。你取出麻绳蹲下身，准备将这些药草连着完整须根一起采下来拿去换钱。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-herbs">
<<tendingicon>><<link "连根采蓝冠草 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-herbs">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 700>><<set _reward to 950>><<elseif ($tending or 0) gte 450>><<set _reward to 720>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
你用手指轻轻拨松腐殖土，将三束品相完好的药草捆扎整齐，送到林边货摊换到了约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_forest_shrine_herbs")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpeavesdropicon>><<link [[向猎人打听 (0:03)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Gwylan]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你拔草时用力过猛，脆弱的根茎在泥土里断成了几截，忙活半天只弄得满手泥浆。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Herbs]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Gwylan [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>林间鹿径上传来踩踏枯枝的轻响，一名背着竹篓的采药人停在石龛旁歇脚。「这座小龛只是外围的路标，」对方看了一眼你衣角沾着的苔藓，抬手指向密林深处，「顺着双生橡树北面的白桦林走，就能找到真正的德鲁伊石环祭坛。」说完对方朝你点点头，转身隐入林雾之中。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<link [[躲进古树根洞 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Hollow]]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[回头查探石龛 (0:05)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Inspect]]>><<set $mpKnown["druid_pillars"] to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Hollow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
两棵古橡树盘根错节的底部围出了一处干爽的树根空腔，刚好能容一人弯腰钻进去避风。空腔内壁的木质坚硬光滑，上面用猎刀刻着一圈记录朔望月交替的古老符号。你靠在散发着木香的树壁上描下那组符号，林间的寒意被隔绝在外。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[应对林外狼嚎 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"]>><<set $mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[钻出树洞回石龛 (0:02)|MP World Event Forest Shrine]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"]>><<set $mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
灌木丛后方忽然响起两声低沉的咆哮，几双幽绿的眼睛在昏暗的蕨类植物间一闪而过。你深吸一口气，伸手抓住古橡树垂下的粗壮横枝。
<<if $mpClues["forest_shrine_rubbing"]>><span class="teal">借着先前拓下的指路古祠符文，你在昏暗林影里一眼认出了可借力攀爬的古橡树枝。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回森林 (0:02)|Forest]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-howl">
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "攀上古橡树杈 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-forest-shrine-howl">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['forest_shrine_rubbing'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	你手脚利落地翻上两米高的树杈，屏息凝神贴紧树干。两只灰狼在石龛下嗅了嗅便转身离去，你有惊无险地滑回地面。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回石龛 (0:03)|MP World Event Forest Shrine]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你慌乱攀爬时靴底踩空，衣摆被枯枝撕开一道口子，在树下瑟瑟发抖地等狼群走远才缓过神来。
	<<stress 6>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Forest Shrine Howl]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
公园长椅下方的灌木丛里落着一册被露水打湿封皮的牛皮速写本，微风吹动着上面细腻的炭笔线条。画纸上勾勒着多瑙河街的铁艺大门与温室穹顶，角落里还压着一枚金属书签。四周的步道上只有几只灰鸽子在啄食面包屑。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<link [[翻看封底夹层 (0:05)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>><<link [[递画页给凯拉尔 (0:04)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Kylar]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">递画页给凯拉尔 (0:04)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去凉亭细看 (0:05)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pavilion]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你坐在公园长椅边将速写本翻到最后一页，发现羊皮封底内侧用细麻线缝着一道暗袋。里面夹着一张烫金卡片与一枚沉甸甸的纯银书签。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-inspect">
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>><<link "挑麻线取书签 (0:10)">><<pass 10>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-inspect">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 300 or ($history or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($english or 0), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1050>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 780>><<else>><<set _reward to 520>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Park_Sketchbook")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你认出卡片上的古典花体字是多瑙河沙龙的入场券，顺手收起那枚银书签与夹层里约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的礼金券。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_park_sketchbook_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[替学生摆姿势 (0:10)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pose]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[甩开公园混混 (0:04)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Bully]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
未干的炭笔粉末蹭脏了你的袖口，你看不懂卡片上的拉丁文缩写，生怕被人当成小偷而心神不宁。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[挑麻线取书签 (0:10)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "挑麻线取书签">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 10>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook Kylar [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
杜鹃花丛后忽然传出踩碎落叶的轻响，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>>凯拉尔<<else>>角落的学生<</if>>捏着半截炭笔从树影里走了出来，目光紧紧盯着你手里的画页。「那是我在长椅边画了一半的速写。」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>>凯拉尔<<else>>角落的学生<</if>>接过你递去的画纸，微凉的指尖飞快地碰了一下你的手背。他低声告诉你，多瑙河街那位贵族每周五都会乘黑马车去温室那边。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Kylar")>><<npcincr Kylar love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[凉亭看图纸 (0:05)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pavilion]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["park_sketch_initials"]>><<set $mpClues["park_sketch_initials"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[看速写本封底 (0:05)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Inspect]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["park_sketch_initials"]>><<set $mpClues["park_sketch_initials"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pavilion [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你走进公园中央的彩窗玻璃凉亭，把速写本平铺在干燥的石圆桌上。中间几页用精细的钢笔线条画着一座高大的铸铁玻璃穹顶，旁边标注着从宅邸花园通往镜面温室的侧门路线。凉亭隔开了外面的湿气，你安心地记下了图纸上的方位。
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["park_sketch_initials"]>><span class="teal">你翻到速写本上带有花房缩写的那一页，顺着钢笔线条找准了玻璃穹顶的方位。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[去喷泉边当模特 (0:10)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pose]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回长椅 (0:02)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<set $mpKnown["glasshouse_dome"] to 1>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pose [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
喷泉池畔的一名美术学院学生正对着画架发愁，看见你走近便礼貌地询问能否请你扶着石栏站十分钟当速写模特。你走到喷泉边调整了一下站姿。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回公园 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-pose">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "扶栏摆站姿 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-pose">>
<<if ($beauty or 0) gte 2000 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set _sk to ($danceskill or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 700 or ($beauty or 0) gte 4000>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 450 or ($beauty or 0) gte 3000>><<set _reward to 900>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你自然地侧过身迎着阳光，衣袂与喷泉水雾相映成趣。学生飞快地画完草图，欣喜地付给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的模特费。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_park_sketchbook_pose")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[避开树荫混混 (0:03)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Bully]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
路过行人的目光让你浑身僵硬，没站几分钟肩膀便酸麻发抖，学生只好遗憾地合上了画板。
<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Pose]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Park Sketchbook Bully [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
两名游手好闲的混混从紫杉树荫下晃了出来，嬉皮笑脸地伸手要抢你怀里的牛皮速写本。你往喷泉湿滑的青苔石阶边退了半步。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-bully">
<<runicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 300>><<link "踩青苔石阶晃开 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-park-sketchbook-bully">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 700>><<set _reward to 850>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 450>><</if>>
你趁领头那人扑空的瞬间用脚尖一勾，让他摔在湿滑的石阶上，顺手捡起他口袋里滚出的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_park_sketchbook_bully")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回长椅 (0:03)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你闪避不及被混混推了一把，手肘擦过粗糙的石子路面，好不容易才护住速写本跑向人多的主路。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Park Sketchbook Bully]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[踩青苔石阶晃开 (0:02)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "踩青苔石阶晃开">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 2>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Temple Censer [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
神殿回廊拐角的黄铜立式香炉下压着一张折叠整齐的宣纸拓片，浓郁的檀香气息在幽暗的石柱间萦绕。走廊两侧的彩绘玻璃窗将外面的天光滤成柔和的淡金色。香炉底座的一只铜足似乎有些松动，你可以上前探查或与走廊上的见习教士交谈。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
