<br>
<<mptranslateicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Sydney")>><<link [[向悉尼请教铭文 (0:05)|MP World Event Temple Censer Sydney]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">向悉尼请教铭文 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
