<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回长廊 (0:02)|MP World Event Temple Censer]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["temple_censer_psalm"]>><<set $mpClues["temple_censer_psalm"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Temple Censer Vigil [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
一名身穿深紫长袍的戒律执事忽然从圣器室侧门走出，目光冰冷地落在你袖口沾着的香灰上。「非祈祷时段不得在后廊逗留，」执事沉声质问你的来意。
<<if $mpClues["temple_censer_psalm"]>><span class="teal">你记着铜香炉底座镌刻的晚祷赞美诗节拍，面对戒律执事盘问时应答得从容得体。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回神殿 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-temple-censer-vigil">
<<mpritualicon>><<link "背圣咏应付盘问 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-temple-censer-vigil">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['temple_censer_psalm'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 450>>
	你神色平静地垂下眼帘，答称自己只是替前厅擦拭烛台后迷了路，执事审视片刻后便挥手放你离开。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcookicon>><<link [[返回香炉 (0:03)|MP World Event Temple Censer]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	执事严厉的目光让你呼吸一滞，你支支吾吾地退后两步，在对方冷酷的训诫声中慌忙逃回前厅。
	<<stress 6>><<trauma 1>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Temple Censer Vigil]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Sewer Cache [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
下水道干燥的检修高台石缝里塞着一只密封的铁皮军用烟盒，盒缝四周涂着厚厚的防潮黑蜡。脚下的暗渠水流潺潺滑过青苔石壁，头顶铸铁管道偶尔滴落温热的水珠。高台侧面的砖墙上画着几道粉笔箭头，旁边的铸铁泄压阀似乎还能转动。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[刮开黑蜡取铁盒 (0:06)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转动铸铁泄压阀 (0:08)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Valve]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<sneakicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 260>><<link [[辨认墙面粉笔箭 (0:05)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Echo]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[辨认墙面粉笔箭 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "辨认墙面粉笔箭">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你踏上检修高台的干砖，伸手探向那只涂满防潮黑蜡的军用铁皮烟盒。石缝内侧绷着一根细如发丝的铜丝，显然连着防盗机关。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回下水道 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-inspect">
<<mpsmokeicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "避开铜丝取烟盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to ((($mpSewerLedgeDry or 0) is 1) ? 260 : 360)>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
	<<set _sk to currentSkillValue("skulduggery")>>
	<<if _sk gte 850>><<set _reward to 1400>><<elseif _sk gte 600>><<set _reward to 1080>><<else>><<set _reward to 760>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Sewer_Cache")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你用指甲拨开铜丝刮去黑蜡，从盒内取出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的不记名银票与一把万能匙坯。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_sewer_cache_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[问拾荒人 (0:05)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Peddler]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[攀铁梯避泄洪 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Surge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
铜丝崩断的瞬间弹起一只生锈的捕鼠铁夹，啪地打在你的手背上，火辣辣的剧痛让你差点滑下高台。
<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[避开铜丝取烟盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "避开铜丝取烟盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Sewer Cache Valve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>>
高台右侧立着一只锈迹斑斑的铸铁泄压手轮，下方连接着通往深层管网的铜质阀门。你双手握住手轮横杆，试着逆时针拧动它。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回下水道 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-valve">
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<link "拧开泄压阀 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-valve">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 9500>>
	<<set _sk to ($science or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 700>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 760>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
<<set $mpKnown["clockwork_steam"] to 1>>
随着一阵低沉的蒸汽嘶鸣，支渠水位迅速下降，露出通往机括城赤铜锅炉室的暗门与冲积在格栅上的约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_sewer_cache_valve")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpsmokeicon>><<link [[回头取铁皮烟盒 (0:03)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
阀门螺纹被水垢死死卡住，你憋红了脸也没能拧动分毫，反而震得双臂酸软无力。
<<tiredness 4>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Valve]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拧开泄压阀 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拧开泄压阀">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 体魄：11000">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Sewer Cache Echo [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你贴着潮湿的红砖拱壁细听，远处的蒸汽机房传来规律的活塞轰鸣。借着壁灯昏黄的光线，你看清高台砖缝下用白粉笔画着一道代表「右侧挂钩」的暗市记号。摸清机关走向后，你再伸手去取铁盒时便能轻易避开里面的铜丝弹簧了。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回下水道 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[取出铁皮盒 (0:05)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Inspect]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["sewer_wax_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["sewer_wax_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpSewerLedgeDry to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[取出铁皮盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "取出铁皮盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向提灯人招呼 (0:05)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Peddler]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["sewer_wax_mark"]>><<set $mpClues["sewer_wax_mark"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<set $mpSewerLedgeDry to 1>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Sewer Cache Peddler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
对岸步道上走来一名提着油灯的巡渠老汉，因为火柴受潮正对着熄灭的灯芯发愁。你从口袋里摸出干燥的火柴递过去替他点亮油灯，老汉感激地朝你点了点头。「上游水闸再过两分钟就要放水冲淤了，」他指了指高台旁边的防滑铁梯，「快往上爬两格，别被浑水冲着。」
<<stress -3>>
<<if $mpClues["sewer_wax_mark"]>><span class="teal">你认出巡渠老汉袖口那枚与暗渠防水匣相同的红蜡记号，主动递上火柴搭话。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<link [[爬上防滑铁梯 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Surge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回高台 (0:02)|MP World Event Sewer Cache]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Sewer Cache Surge [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
隧道深处忽然传来沉闷的铁闸起吊声，齐膝深的浑浊水流夹杂着碎木块咆哮而至，瞬间漫过了底层步道。你急忙伸手去抓嵌入砖墙的防滑铁梯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回主渠 (0:02)|Sewers Algae]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "sewers">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-surge">
<<mpclimbicon>><<link "爬嵌墙铁梯 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-sewer-cache-surge">>
<<if ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 300 or ($athletics or 0) gte 350>>
	你双臂发力一跃而起，稳稳踩住高处第三根铁横档，任凭湍急的洪流从脚底冲刷而过，滴水未沾地回到干爽平台。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回高台 (0:03)|MP World Event Sewer Cache]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	浑浊的浪头狠狠撞在你的小腿上，你的手掌在湿滑的铁条上擦破了皮，费尽力气才爬上高台边缘。
	<<pain 4>><<stress 6>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Sewer Cache Surge]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

