	<<investigateicon>><<link [[替跑腿人送信 (0:08)|MP World Event Barb Patrol BribeDrop]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[避开警犬搜寻 (0:04)|MP World Event Barb Patrol Hound]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
靴底踢翻了墙角的空啤酒罐，巡警猛地转过身用手电筒照住你，上前粗暴地推了你一把将你赶开。
<<pain 3>><<stress 6>>
