:: MP World Event Barb Patrol Whitney [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>>惠特尼<<else>>领头的学生<</if>>正靠在公寓外侧的铁艺栏杆上抽烟，冷笑着看街口的巡警来回盘查。看见你从阴影里走出来，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>>惠特尼<<else>>领头的学生<</if>>吐出一口烟圈挑起眉梢：「算你跑得快，那帮条子今晚是替贝利催黑账的。」你靠在栏杆边替<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>>惠特尼<<else>>领头的学生<</if>>挡住街风，<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>>惠特尼<<else>>领头的学生<</if>>哼了一声，没再找你麻烦。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>><<npcincr Whitney love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<<if $mpClues["barb_patrol_receipt"]>><span class="teal">你揣着楼梯间拾到的巡警换岗签收条，迎着<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Whitney")>>惠特尼<<else>>领头的学生<</if>>挑起的眉梢从容走出阴影。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[接跑腿差事 (0:08)|MP World Event Barb Patrol BribeDrop]]>><<pass 8>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回排水管 (0:02)|MP World Event Barb Patrol]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Barb Patrol BribeDrop [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
后巷阴影里钻出一名气喘吁吁的地下信使，塞给你一只火漆信封，许诺只要你帮他把信带过街口哨卡就分你一半跑腿费。你整理了一下衣领走向街口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-barb-patrol-bribedrop">
<<mpsneakicon>><<link "藏信封过哨卡 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-barb-patrol-bribedrop">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 300 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($athletics or 0), ($seductionskill or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
你神色自若地迎着哨卡走去，三言两语引开值勤警员的注意，顺利在对街交出信封并拿到了约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 报酬。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_barb_patrol_bribedrop")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpanimalicon>><<link [[绕开牵犬巡警 (0:03)|MP World Event Barb Patrol Hound]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你在路障前紧张得步履僵硬，被值勤警员拦下盘问了半天，只能趁乱把信封退回后巷。
<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP World Event Barb Patrol BribeDrop]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Barb Patrol Hound [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
一阵急促的铁链声从街尾逼近，一条体型健硕的警犬正嗅着地面朝排水管拐角狂吠而来。你迅速退到公寓后院的铸铁煤箱旁边。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回倒钩街 (0:02)|Barb Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "barb">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-barb-patrol-hound">
<<runicon>><<link "翻上煤箱撒胡椒 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-barb-patrol-hound">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400 or ($athletics or 0) gte 320>>
	你冷静地抓起一把刺鼻的煤灰撒在靴底，翻上矮墙屏住呼吸，警犬在煤箱前打了个喷嚏便转向了另一条巷子。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[离开暗巷 (0:03)|MP World Event Barb Patrol]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你慌不择路地往铁栅栏外翻越，裤腿被尖锐的铁刺勾住，小腿划出一道血痕才勉强逃脱。
	<<pain 4>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Barb Patrol Hound]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Danube Carriage [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
一辆挂着暗红丝绒窗帘的黑色双轮马车从多瑙河街驶过，车轮碾过凹陷石板时震落了一只紫檀小盒。马车夫并未察觉异样，在梧桐树影下渐行渐远。紫檀小盒落在路边的落叶堆里，盒盖上的银质搭扣在路灯下泛着温润的光泽。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
