<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[追上侍从还盒 (0:06)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Footman]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退进门房 (0:04)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Porch]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Danube Carriage Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你借着路边梧桐树干的遮挡快步上前，将那只紫檀小盒拢进袖口。盒内铺着深紫丝绒衬垫，上面嵌着一枚蓝宝石袖扣与几张折好的钞票。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
