<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你悄然取走袖扣与衬垫下约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的晚宴礼金，将空木盒放回树根阴影里。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_danube_carriage_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[去侧门帮佣 (0:12)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Errand]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[应对护卫询问 (0:04)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Guard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
二楼雕花铁窗后忽然亮起烛光，一名老管家隔着玻璃朝街面张望，吓得你急忙松手退开。
<<stress 5>>
