:: MP World Event Danube Carriage Errand [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
宅邸侧门的女仆领班正捧着一叠名流拜帖忙得不可开交，见你在门边驻足，便招手请你过去搭把手。她递给你一把硬毛铜刷和一只银托盘，让你帮忙刷净脚踏毯再按姓氏排好拜帖。
<<if $mpClues["danube_crest_seal"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前认出的马车门板鸢尾家徽，你在帮女仆领班分拣名流拜帖时一眼挑出了急件。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-danube-carriage-errand">
<<mpcleanicon>><<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['danube_crest_seal'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 280 or ($english or 0) gte 280>><<link "铜刷扫毯排拜帖 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-danube-carriage-errand">>
<<if (($housekeeping or 0) + ($mpClues['danube_crest_seal'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 280 or ($english or 0) gte 280>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($housekeeping or 0), ($english or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1100>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 850>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
你迅速刷掉羊毛毯上的泥点，又将三十多张烫金拜帖分毫不差地码进银盘，领班满意地付给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_danube_carriage_errand")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[向护卫致意 (0:03)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Guard]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
你不小心把泥水蹭到了一张洒金拜帖边缘，被女仆领班数落了几句，忙活半天只觉得手腕发酸。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP World Event Danube Carriage Errand]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[铜刷扫毯排拜帖 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "铜刷扫毯排拜帖">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Danube Carriage Guard [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
一名身材高大的私人护卫顺着鹅卵石车道走来，按着腰间的警棍询问你在大宅门前做什么。你神态镇定地提到自己是替<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Briar")>>布莱尔<<else>>俱乐部东家<</if>>和<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>>艾弗里<<else>>多瑙河富商<</if>>送请柬的帮工，并指了指刚驶离的马车车辙。护卫上下打量了你一眼，紧绷的神色缓和下来，侧身让开了通往街口的道路。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Avery")>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回多瑙河街 (0:08)|Danube Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<pass 8>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回落叶堆 (0:02)|MP World Event Danube Carriage]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event School Corridor [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if Time.hour gte 15 or Time.dayState is "dusk">>放学后的教学楼走廊储物柜旁，<<else>>课间安静的教学楼走廊储物柜旁，<</if>>一扇锁舌损坏的旧铁柜门半掩着，露出底层一卷泛黄的社团手札。<<if Time.dayState is "dusk">>夕阳透过走廊尽头的高窗<<else>>天光透过走廊尽头的高窗<</if>>洒在水磨石地面上，远处传来值日生推着拖把桶走过的回声。你可以上前翻看铁柜底层，或者先读一读那卷天文社手札。
