<<else>>
变形的铁皮柜门突然发出刺耳的摩擦声，走廊另一头传来风纪委员的脚步声，吓得你连忙合上柜门。
<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event School Corridor Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摸索防尘袋 (0:10)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸索防尘袋">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 10>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event School Corridor Logbook [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你翻开那卷泛黄的天文社观测手札，内页夹着一张绘有小镇北侧山脊线的赤纬坐标图。你需要根据旁边的折射公式算出观测点的具体位置。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-school-corridor-logbook">
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($maths or 0) gte 300>><<link "推算赤纬坐标 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-school-corridor-logbook">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 300 or ($maths or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set $mpKnown["observatory_dome"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["school_star_log"]>><<set $mpClues["school_star_log"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>>
	你顺着游标读数很快算出交点就在断崖观星台的主穹顶，手札末尾还记着观星台备用侧门的开启方式。
	<<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcarryicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<link [[帮礼顿搬试卷袋 (0:03)|MP World Event School Corridor Leighton]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">帮礼顿搬试卷袋 (0:03)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<<else>>
	繁琐的球面三角公式让你算错了好几行数字，看着密密麻麻的星表只觉得脑仁发胀。
	<<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP World Event School Corridor Logbook]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[推算赤纬坐标 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "推算赤纬坐标">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 数学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event School Corridor Leighton [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>正抱着两摞厚重的牛皮纸试卷袋从楼梯口走上来，镜片后的目光扫过储物柜边的你。你主动上前接过上面那摞档案袋，帮<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>一路抱到教研室门前。「<<if Time.hour gte 15>>放学后还留在学校倒也难得<<else>>课余还主动在走廊搭把手倒也难得<</if>>，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>伸手接过试卷袋，语气比平时缓和了几分，叮嘱你整理完储物柜就早点回去。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>><<npcincr Leighton love 1>><</if>><<stress -2>>
<<if $mpClues["school_star_log"]>><span class="teal">你记着旧储物柜里那页天文观测日志的编号，帮<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Leighton")>>礼顿<<else>>值班校官<</if>>整理试卷袋时顺手对上了目录。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[辅导低年级生 (0:10)|MP World Event School Corridor Tutoring]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[回铁柜查探 (0:05)|MP World Event School Corridor Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP World Event School Corridor Tutoring [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
走廊长椅上一名低年级学生正抓着头发改写明日要交的历史读书报告。见你从储物柜边走过，对方怯生生地举起草稿本，请求你帮忙润色两页语法与史实引文。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-school-corridor-tutoring">
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>><<link "润色报告引文 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-school-corridor-tutoring">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 280 or ($history or 0) gte 280>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($english or 0), ($history or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 700>><<set _reward to 900>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 680>><<else>><<set _reward to 460>><</if>>
你拿起红笔勾出几处年代错误，替对方补上通顺的结语，学生千恩万谢地塞给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的零花钱。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_school_corridor_tutoring")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[转入楼梯间 (0:03)|MP World Event School Corridor Prefect]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
对方潦草的字迹让你看得眼花缭乱，改了半天反而越涂越乱，只能尴尬地把本子还了回去。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP World Event School Corridor Tutoring]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[润色报告引文 (0:04)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "润色报告引文">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 历史等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>
</div>

:: MP World Event School Corridor Prefect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你闪进走廊尽头的副楼梯间，这里平时很少有人经过，<<if Time.dayState is "dusk">>只有夕阳斜照在干净的水泥台阶上<<else>>只有窗外天光斜照在干净的水泥台阶上<</if>>。主走廊里那群喧哗的高年级学生说说笑笑地走远了，谁也没有往楼梯转角这边看上一眼。你靠在窗台边把刚收集到的社团笔记收进贴身口袋，心情格外平静。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回教学楼 (0:02)|Hallways]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回铁柜 (0:02)|MP World Event School Corridor]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
学校泳池更衣室角落的排水木格栅下闪过一抹亮光，温热的水汽正顺着浅蓝瓷砖地面缓缓流淌。空气里弥漫着淡淡的消毒水味，隔壁泳池大厅传来清脆的划水声。你可以蹲下身掀开木格栅看看，或者先去池边和<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>打个招呼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[掀开排水格栅 (0:05)|MP World Event Pool Steam Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[掀开排水格栅 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "掀开排水格栅">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<link [[找梅森聊聊 (0:05)|MP World Event Pool Steam Mason]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">找梅森聊聊 (0:05)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[收拾湿毛巾 (0:10)|MP World Event Pool Steam Clean]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你蹲在温热的瓷砖地面上，用手指扣住杉木排水格栅的边缘轻轻往上抬。格栅下方的浅水槽里卡着一条金链与一只密封的防水铜管。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-inspect">
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "抬格栅捞铜管 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 280>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($swimmingskill or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 750>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 500>><<set _reward to 750>><<else>><<set _reward to 500>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Pool_Steam")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你灵巧地勾出那条纯金吊坠与九号储物牌，拧开防水铜管倒出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的备用硬币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_pool_steam_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[核对九号柜 (0:05)|MP World Event Pool Steam Locker]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[避开嬉闹学生 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Prank]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
湿滑的杉木格栅突然脱手砸下，压痛了你的无名指指尖，你只好揉着手指先站起身来。
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Pool Steam Mason [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>正蹲在深水区池畔盘拢蓝白相间的分道浮绳，水珠顺着健硕的肩背滑落。你走上前帮<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>扶住浮标转轴，顺便问起更衣室旧储物柜的事。「最里面那排器材柜是以前潜水社留下的，」<<if $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>>梅森<<else>>游泳教练<</if>>冲你爽朗一笑，顺便教了你一个在水下耳压平衡时放松胸腔的换气诀窍。
<<if $NPCName and $NPCNameList and $NPCNameList.includes("Mason")>><<npcincr Mason love 1>><</if>><<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查九号器材柜 (0:05)|MP World Event Pool Steam Locker]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[拖干更衣室 (0:10)|MP World Event Pool Steam Clean]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam Clean [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
更衣室长凳上堆着十几条刚换下来的湿毛巾，地面也湿漉漉的。你拿起墙角的橡胶刮水推杆，准备在下节课的学生进来前把通道清理干净。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-clean">
<<mpcleanicon>><<link "刮更衣室积水 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-clean">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($physique or 0) gte 8000>>
	<<set _sk to ($housekeeping or 0)>>
	<<if _sk gte 700>><<set _reward to 850>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 650>><<else>><<set _reward to 450>><</if>>
你三两下将湿毛巾叠进竹篓，又把瓷砖水渍推进排水口，器材管理员笑着塞给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的勤工补贴。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_pool_steam_clean")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[查九号器材柜 (0:03)|MP World Event Pool Steam Locker]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
脚底的肥皂沫让你差点劈叉滑倒，沉重的湿毛巾篓也搬得你双臂发酸。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Clean]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam Locker [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你走进温暖干燥的毛巾烘干室，顺着角落那排旧铁柜找到印着「玖」字的柜门。拉开柜门后，里面挂着一副老式黄铜护目镜，镜盒底下压着一张塑封防水卡片，详细记录着海岸礁洞与海蚀回音廊的平潮时间表。你把卡片上的时刻记在心里，重新掩好了柜门。
<<stress -2>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[避开门外人群 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Prank]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["pool_locker_token"]>><<set $mpClues["pool_locker_token"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回格栅 (0:02)|MP World Event Pool Steam]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["pool_locker_token"]>><<set $mpClues["pool_locker_token"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Pool Steam Prank [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
更衣室弹簧门忽然被一群刚下课的学生推开，几个人手里端着水盆在过道里互相泼水起哄。你抓起架子上的干浴巾披在肩上，准备从侧面绕出去。
<<if $mpClues["pool_locker_token"]>><span class="teal">你攥着在更衣室排水格栅边摸到的铜号牌，趁学生泼水哄闹时贴着墙根绕向侧门。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游泳池 (0:02)|School Pool]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pool">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-prank">
<<runicon>><<link "披浴巾闪避 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-pool-steam-prank">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['pool_locker_token'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 300 or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	你看准他们转身打闹的空档，贴着干燥的储物柜壁快步穿出走廊，身上没有溅到半滴冷水。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回格栅 (0:03)|MP World Event Pool Steam]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	一盆微凉的池水泼在你的脚边，哄笑声让你耳根发热，只能快步退向门口。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Pool Steam Prank]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Arcade Neon [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "arcade">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
星鱼街游戏厅闪烁的霓虹灯影下，最里侧那台老式兑币机的退币口卡着几枚厚重的错版黄铜币。嘈杂的电子音效与摇杆敲击声在室内回荡，空气里飘着爆米花与臭氧的气味。你可以试着拍击兑币机侧板，或者拿着代用币去柜台打听。
