:: MP World Event Arcade Neon Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "arcade">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你站在老式兑币机侧面，手指顺着铸铁退币槽摸到里面卡死的三枚厚重黄铜币。只要找准弹簧棘轮的节点轻轻一震，就能让硬币滑落下来。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回游戏厅 (0:02)|Arcade]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "arcade">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-arcade-neon-inspect">
