<<set $seductiondifficulty to 4000>><<seductioncheck>>
<<if $seductionrating gte $seductionrequired or ($willpower or 0) gte 400>>
	你落落大方地扬起手里的木质号牌，微笑着说自己刚帮裁缝试完披肩尺寸，保安礼貌地点头致歉后便走开了。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回镜前 (0:03)|MP World Event Shopping Mirror]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	保安审视的目光让你脸颊发烫，你匆忙把号牌塞回衣架上，在对方狐疑的注视下快步走出廊道。
	<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Shopping Mirror Guard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Hospital Night [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
医院庭院偏僻处的木长椅边放着一只未上锁的旧皮质医药箱，空气里飘着淡淡的缬草与医用酒精味。不远处的急诊室玻璃门透出惨白的灯光，<<if Time.dayState is "night" or Time.dayState is "dusk">>夜风吹得庭院里的冬青树叶沙沙作响<<else>>微凉的穿堂风吹得庭院里的冬青树叶沙沙作响<</if>>。你可以打开药箱查看里面的药剂，或者把药箱拎进温暖的<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜班走廊<<else>>值班走廊<</if>>。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[查验药箱夹层 (0:05)|MP World Event Hospital Night Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[交还空箱给护士 (0:05)|MP World Event Hospital Night Nurse]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[帮忙贴标签 (0:12)|MP World Event Hospital Night Sort]]>><<pass 12>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Hospital Night Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你蹲在木长椅旁拨开黄铜锁扣，轻轻掀开旧皮质医药箱的顶盖。上层隔板放着普通的止血纱布，下层防震绒垫里却整齐码着三支贴有手写编码的琥珀色安瓿瓶。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:02)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-hospital-night-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 320>><<link "排好安瓿编码 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-hospital-night-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 320>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($science or 0) gte 320>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($science or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1250>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 950>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 700 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Hospital_Night")>>
<<set $mpContrabandSealed to ($mpContrabandSealed or 0) + 1>>
<</if>>
你认出这是黑市高价收购的镇静原液，收好药剂与箱底约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的采购押金。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_hospital_night_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<socialiseicon>><<link [[走进走廊找护士 (0:05)|MP World Event Hospital Night Nurse]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[绕过护工 (0:04)|MP World Event Hospital Night Orderly]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
你不小心碰裂了一支装着苦味酊剂的玻璃管，刺鼻的药水味沾在指尖，吓得你连忙合上箱盖。
<<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Hospital Night Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[排好安瓿编码 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "排好安瓿编码">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术检定成功 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Hospital Night Nurse [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你推开玻璃门走进暖气充足的医院<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜班走廊<<else>>值班走廊<</if>>，把那只旧皮箱放到分诊台上。正在核对病历的值班护士感激地松了口气，给你倒了一杯温水。「<<if Time.dayState is "night">>今晚多亏你捡回来<<else>>今天多亏你捡回来<</if>>，」护士一边登记一边小声嘀咕，「下午孤儿院那边刚派人来问过整箱镇静合剂的库存，药房都快忙乱套了。」
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回庭院 (0:02)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[分装纱布 (0:12)|MP World Event Hospital Night Sort]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["hospital_sedative_log"]>><<set $mpClues["hospital_sedative_log"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 12>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[绕过护工 (0:04)|MP World Event Hospital Night Orderly]]>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["hospital_sedative_log"]>><<set $mpClues["hospital_sedative_log"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Hospital Night Sort [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "hospital">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
室内耗材室的白炽灯还亮着，玻璃柜里摆满了刚消毒完的器皿。一名<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜班药剂师<<else>>当班药剂师<</if>>正对着满桌未贴签的药瓶发愁，见你经过便请你搭把手按浓度贴好标签。
<<if $mpClues["hospital_sedative_log"]>><span class="teal">对照值班室记录本上的宁神剂批号，你帮夜班药剂师分拣无签药瓶时没有出一处差错。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回医院 (0:02)|Hospital front]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "hospital">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
