<<mpherbicon>><<link "按浓度贴药签 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-hospital-night-sort">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['hospital_sedative_log'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(($science or 0), ($housekeeping or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 700>><<set _reward to 1000>><<elseif _sk gte 450>><<set _reward to 760>><<else>><<set _reward to 550>><</if>>
你仔细核对瓶身刻度，将四十只玻璃瓶与纱布卷整整齐齐码进铁盘，药剂师从值班费里分给你约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span>。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_hospital_night_sort")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP World Event Hospital Night Orderly]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
浓重的消毒水气味熏得你直打哈欠，你不小心贴反了两排标签，只好花时间一张张重新揭下来。
<<tiredness 3>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP World Event Hospital Night Sort]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

