</div>

:: MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
农田边界的冬青树篱根部露出一截中空的古橡木桩，树洞内壁被人用防水桐油仔细涂抹过。旷野上的风吹过金黄的麦茬地，远处传来拖拉机低沉的轰鸣声。树洞深处隐约卡着一只防潮锡罐，你可以伸手探查，或者先钻进旁边的干草谷仓避风。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link [[摸索橡木洞 (0:05)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Inspect]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><<link [[摸索橡木洞 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "摸索橡木洞">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[钻进谷仓看图 (0:05)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Barn]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[装运干草捆 (0:15)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Bale]]>><<pass 15>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Inspect [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
你顺着田埂跪坐在老橡木桩前，先用木棍压倒洞口带刺的荨麻叶。树洞内部干燥深邃，你的指尖很快在桐油木壁底部触到一只四方铁盒。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerow-inspect">
<<investigateicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>><<link "压倒荨麻摸盒 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerow-inspect">>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 300>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1 or ($tending or 0) gte 300>>
	<<set _sk to Math.max(currentSkillValue("skulduggery"), ($tending or 0))>>
	<<if _sk gte 800>><<set _reward to 1150>><<elseif _sk gte 550>><<set _reward to 880>><<else>><<set _reward to 600>><</if>>
<<if _sk gte 650 and window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_inline_MP_World_Event_Farmland_Hedgerow")>>
<<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span>
<</if>>
你慢慢将四方铁盒托出树洞，掀开盒盖清点里面的庄园旧地契残页。衬布下还整齐码着约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的早年银币。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_farmland_hedgerow_inspect")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -3>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[进谷仓看地契 (0:05)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Barn]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[安抚巡田护院犬 (0:04)|MP World Event Farmland HedgerowHound]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
洞口边缘的刺荨麻蛰到了你的手腕，火辣辣的麻痒感让你急忙把手缩了回来。
<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Inspect]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[压倒荨麻摸盒 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "压倒荨麻摸盒">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
</div>
:: MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Barn [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $mpKnown to ($mpKnown or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
你推开厚重的木门钻进干草谷仓，干燥温暖的麦秸香气扑面而来。你坐在草垛上展开那张泛黄的羊皮地契残页，看到田界北端用红墨水标着一条通往沉没修道院旧酒窖的排水暗沟。记下这条隐秘路径后，你在松软的干草垛上歇了口气。
<<stress -3>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link [[帮农夫搬草捆 (0:15)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Bale]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["farm_deed_boundary"]>><<set $mpClues["farm_deed_boundary"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 15>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[应对田埂护院犬 (0:04)|MP World Event Farmland HedgerowHound]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<set $mpKnown["abbey_scriptorium"] to 1>><<if !$mpClues or !$mpClues["farm_deed_boundary"]>><<set $mpClues["farm_deed_boundary"] to 1>><span class="blue">线索已记录</span><</if>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Bale [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
一辆装满草料的平板拖车停在泥泞的田埂边，车轮陷进了浅沟里。满头大汗的农夫见你走近，便招呼你搭把手把地上六捆干草叉上车斗，答应干完现结工钱。
<<if $mpClues["farm_deed_boundary"]>><span class="teal">你对照田埂界石旁记下的旧农庄地界，帮农夫往车斗叉干草时找准了最省力的支点。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerow-bale">
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "草叉叉草上拖车 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerow-bale">>
<<if (($physique or 0) + ($mpClues['farm_deed_boundary'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 9500>>
	<<if ($physique or 0) gte 14000>><<set _reward to 1200>><<elseif ($physique or 0) gte 11500>><<set _reward to 920>><<else>><<set _reward to 650>><</if>>
你握紧双齿木叉沉腰发力，稳稳当当地把六捆干草码上车斗，农夫爽快地数出约 <span class="gold">£<<print Math.floor(_reward / 100)>></span> 的铜币与纸钞递给你。
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("world_ev_mp_world_event_farmland_hedgerow_bale")>><<money _reward>><</if>><<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpfarmicon>><<link [[应对巡田护院犬 (0:03)|MP World Event Farmland HedgerowHound]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
湿重的干草捆压得木叉剧烈弯曲，你闪了一下后腰，草捆散落一地，只能揉着酸痛的腰背退到路边。
<<tiredness 4>><<pain 2>><<stress 3>>
	<br><br>
	<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow Bale]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP World Event Farmland HedgerowHound [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
树篱另一头忽然窜出一条体格壮硕的黄色护院猎犬，喉咙里发出低沉的呼噜声朝你小跑过来。你停在木制跨栏旁边，没有贸然转身逃跑。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerowhound">
<<mpanimalicon>><<link "蹲下轻抚犬耳 (0:02)">><<pass 2>><<replace "#act-mp-world-event-farmland-hedgerowhound">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 320 or ($athletics or 0) gte 320>>
	你吹出一声柔和的牧羊口哨并顺势翻过木跨栏，猎犬歪头听了听便摇着尾巴转身巡视去了。
	<<stress -2>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回橡木桩 (0:03)|MP World Event Farmland Hedgerow]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你慌忙翻越木栏时小腿刮在带刺的铁丝网上，留下一道浅浅的血印才落荒而逃。
	<<pain 3>><<stress 5>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[扶稳器座重调角度 (0:04)|MP World Event Farmland HedgerowHound]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

